OL,4,CPrince Harry says he would rejoin army 
OL,5,Cas he warns of Russia threat           
OL,6,GThe Duke of Sussex, who carried out a  
OL,7,Gsurprise visit to Ukraine at the       
OL,8,Gweekend, has said he would rejoin the  
OL,9,Gmilitary if asked, as he warned of the 
OL,10,Gthreat from Russia.                    
OL,12,FHe told the Telegraph he thought       
OL,13,Fpeople were right to be nervous in the 
OL,14,Fcurrent international political        
OL,15,Fclimate and said it was time to        
OL,16,F"double our support" for Ukraine.      
